flowchart LR
  N([new]) -->|interpreted, items open| R[needs_review]
  N -->|interpreted, nothing blocking| A[ready_for_action]
  R -->|facts and reviews resolved| A
  A -->|material change or new message| R
  A -->|booking committed, nothing open| D[resolved]
  R -->|Mark reply sent - reported| W[awaiting_guest]
  R -->|Escalate to private events| E[escalated]
  R -->|Close or Decline, with reason| C[closed]
  W --> M((new guest<br/>message))
  E --> M
  C --> M
  D --> M
  M --> R
